      <div class="skill-bar-wrap"><div class="skill-bar-label"><span>Proficiency</span><span>90%</span></div><div class="skill-bar-bg"><div class="skill-bar" style="width:90%"></div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="skill-card">
      <div class="skill-num">04</div>
      <div class="skill-icon-wrap">🧍</div>
      <div class="skill-name">Ragdoll Systems</div>
      <div class="skill-desc">Dynamic ragdolling on knockback and death events, with smooth blending back to animation state and physics-accurate reactions.</div>
      <div class="skill-bar-wrap"><div class="skill-bar-label"><span>Proficiency</span><span>88%</span></div><div class="skill-bar-bg"><div class="skill-bar" style="width:88%"></div></div></div>
    </div>
