<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">03 — About</div>
    <h2>WHO I <span>AM</span></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="about-quote">"I don't just write code — I build the systems that make a game feel real."</div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>I'm KingCoder — a dedicated Lua and Roblox game developer with 5+ years of experience building full-scale game systems from scratch. I've been scripting since I was young and it's more than a skill, it's how I think.</p>
        <p>I specialize in the systems that players feel most — combat that responds instantly, movement that flows naturally, abilities that look and feel powerful. The difference between a good game and a great one is in these details, and that's where I focus.</p>
        <p>I'm easy to work with, communicate clearly, and take deadlines seriously. Whether you need one system or an entire game built from the ground up, I deliver.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
